    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d643-a1">

                <pb facs="0550" n="434" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg434"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The President of the Chinese Colony
                            at Guayaquil to the American
                        Minister</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>[<hi rendition="#small-caps">Seal of the Chinese Colony.</hi>] <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Guayaquil</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-02-24">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 24, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to transmit herewith a
                        statement<anchor n="1" xml:id="d643-f1"/> of the losses sustained by Chinese
                    citizens in Ecuador during the revolution commencing December 28, 1911. These
                    losses were the result of operations both by the Constitutional and
                    revolutionary forces.</p>
                <p>This statement is an outline only on the Chinese losses and is extracted from
                    detailed documents sustained by competent witnesses. It is sent for your
                    immediate information with a view of elaborating a scheme of presentation and
                    collection.</p>
                <pb facs="0551" n="435" xml:id="pg435"/>
                <p>A copy of this communication will be sent by this mail to Mr. Young, now in
                    Washington, and to the Chinese Minister, in order that conferences may be held
                    regarding the disposition of this claim.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">C. Santon Tay Sing.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
